then practice with the methods that actually work for you.

Over 60 million students, teachers, and lifelong learners use Quizlet to study smarter, including 2 in 3 high schoolers and 1 in 2 college students. Students say Quizlet is the fastest way to prepare for a test and 87% say it helps them build a real study habit.

Turn any material into study tools in seconds
- Audio Recording: Record or upload a lecture and Quizlet turns it into organized study guides and flashcards automatically, so you can spend less time transcribing, more time learning.
- Flashcards &amp; Study Guides: Type, paste, or upload your notes and Quizlet builds a complete study set for you.
- Ask Quizlet: Get instant, clear explanations for to get unstuck on homework or practice problems. 

Study in the moments that work for you
- Podcasts: Turn your notes, sets, and study guides into conversational audio you can review on your commute, at the gym, or anywhere you're not at a desk.
- Learn: Adaptive practice that meets you at your level and adjusts as you improve.

Practice with confidence, not guesswork
- Practice Tests: Simulate the real thing so you walk in ready.
- Spaced Repetition: Quizlet intelligently resurfaces exactly what you need to review, right when you need it, so what you learn actually sticks.
- Retention insights: Track your mastery over time instead of hoping it's sinking in.

Make studying something you want to come back to
- Charms: A puzzle game that turns your real course material into something genuinely fun to play.
- Study With Friends: Track progress alongside classmates and turn solo study anxiety into shared accountability.

Why students trust Quizlet
- 2 in 3 students trust Quizlet more than any other study app
- 87% of students say Quizlet helps them build a study habit

Source: Quizlet Survey, May 2026

Quizlet is the study platform that adapts to you. Start strong, stay on track, and finish strong with confidence.

Quizlet Plus subscriptions will be charged to your iTunes account. Your monthly or annual subscription automatically renews unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage your subscriptions in your Account Settings after purchase. Some features may not be available in your country or region. 

Terms of Service: https://quizlet.com/tos
Privacy Policy: https://quizlet.com/privacy<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></span></span> </div> <button class="svelte-158dia6">more</button></p> </section> <section id="productRatings" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top">  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1oivr99">  <a aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/546473125?see-all=reviews&amp;platform=iphone" data-test-id="internal-link" class="svelte-jrkm1h"><div class="link-contents svelte-1oivr99"><h2 class="shelf-title svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-title">Ratings &amp; Reviews</h2> <span class="chevron-container svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-see-all-chevron" aria-hidden="true">   <svg viewBox="0 0 51.108 87.687" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M51.108 43.834c-.018-1.997-.718-3.638-2.334-5.23L11.214 1.877C9.974.6 8.453 0 6.64 0 2.96 0 .001 2.897.001 6.55 0 8.326.765 10.004 2.068 11.344l33.398 32.472L2.07 76.325C.784 77.665 0 79.305 0 81.137c0 3.653 2.96 6.55 6.641 6.55 1.796 0 3.334-.601 4.572-1.877l37.561-36.746c1.636-1.591 2.334-3.25 2.334-5.23"></path></svg></span></div> </a></div>    <ul style="--grid-max-content-xsmall: 298px; --grid-column-gap-xsmall: 10px; --grid-row-gap-xsmall: 24px; --grid-small: 2; --grid-column-gap-small: 20px; --grid-row-gap-small: 24px; --grid-medium: 2; --grid-column-gap-medium: 20px; --grid-row-gap-medium: 24px; --grid-large: 3; --grid-column-gap-large: 20px; --grid-row-gap-large: 24px; --grid-xlarge: 3; --grid-column-gap-xlarge: 20px; --grid-row-gap-xlarge: 24px;" class="grid svelte-7iyek8" data-test-id="grid"><li><div class="svelte-102wyj3"><div class="amp-rating svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="rating-component"> <div class="stats svelte-z92vmb" role="text"><div class="stats__main svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__average-rating">4.8</div> <div class="stats__total svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__total-text">out of 5</div></div> <div class="numbers svelte-z92vmb"><div 