ideGamut":false}]},"title":"LookUp: English Dictionary App","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":false,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Dictionary, Vocabulary Builder","tertiaryTitle":null,"tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Dictionary, Vocabulary Builder","editorialTagline":"Build your vocabulary.","editorialDescription":"With apologies to the nice people at Oxford, dictionaries don’t usually look all that great. But LookUp is a dictionary for those with a penchant for aesthetics; the app delivers its daily definitions with illustrations that trigger both sides of your brain. Learn from a mahoosive collection of words like reticent, impresario, and mahoosive, which, we just learned, is really a word. Tap a card for pronunciations, origins, and synonyms; heart a word if you have a particular adulation for it.","shortEditorialDescription":"Learn new words with this complication ","ageRating":"4+","productDescription":"Build your English vocabulary the smart way. LookUp combines an Oxford-powered dictionary with beautiful Word of the Day, spaced repetition quizzes, and personal word collections, all in one award-winning app.\n\nDiscover words beautifully: A new illustrated Word of the Day, every day. Visual memory aids make new words stick faster than reading definitions alone. Tap the widget on your Home Screen or Lock Screen to never miss a word.\n\nLook up any word, instantly: Powered by Oxford English Dictionary; the world's most trusted source. Get definitions, thesaurus, audio pronunciations, example sentences, usage notes, and translations in 20+ languages.\n\nBuild your personal vocabulary: Save words to your own collections. Then master them with flashcards, example sentence quizzes, conversation practice, and interactive exercises — all powered by scientifically proven Spaced Repetition.\n\nPerfect for exams & every day life: Whether you're prepping for GRE, SAT, TOEFL, IELTS, or simply a lover of words. LookUp is built for anyone serious about language.\n\nApp Store Editor's Choice · Webby Honoree 2021 · MacStories Update of the Year 2019 \"Far and away my favorite dictionary app.\" - MacStories\n\n—\n*Translations Supported for: Arabic, Chinese, Hindi, Indonesian, Malay, Turkmen, Tajik, German, Italian, Greek, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Spanish, Tatar, Igbo, isiXhosa, isiZulu, Northern Sotho, Setswana, Yoruba, Tok Pisin, and more to come.\n\nLookUp+ Terms of Use: https://squircleapps.com/lookup/terms/\n\nStandard Apple Terms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/","rating":4.7,"ratingCount":"3.1K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=872564448&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891856934"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","idType":"its_id","id":"872564448"},{"locationPosition":5,"locationType":"lockup","name":"LookUp: English Dictionary App","idType":"its_id","id":"872564448"},{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"todayCard","name":"Ace Your Homework","idType":"its_id","id":"1286384309"},{"locationPosition":11,"locationType":"swoosh","name":"Featured In","idType":"sequential","id":"25"}],"jet_adamId":"872564448","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"872564448","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":false}],"custom":{"jet_adamId":"872564448"}},"$kind":"OfferAction","actionClass":"OfferAction","adamId":"872564448","purchaseConfiguration":{"$kind":"PurchaseConfiguration","buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=872564448&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891856934","vendor":"Squircle Apps LLP","appName":"LookUp: English Dictionary App","bund