 learning feel like a game\n- Spaced repetition and active recall: Gizmo uses the most advanced techniques to help you remember what you learn\n- Pre-made decks: Quickly find 1,000,000+ free public flashcards made by other students\n- Organised: Organise your studying with files and decks\n- Gamified: Make study into a game!\n\n- Free flashcards\n- AI learning assistant / AI tutor\n- Active recall quizzes\n- Spaced repetition\n- Leaderboards and study games\n- Simple and minimalistic aesthetic\n- Scan pictures and photos to make flashcards\n- Shared decks\n- Multiple choice questions\n- Written questions\n\nAs seen on TikTok and Instagram Terms of use - https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/","rating":4.8,"ratingCount":"14K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1610516671&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891611119"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1610516671"},{"locationPosition":3,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Gizmo: AI Tutor","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1610516671"},{"locationPosition":13,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"1610516671","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"1610516671","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":false}],"custom":{"jet_adamId":"1610516671"}},"$kind":"OfferAction","actionClass":"OfferAction","adamId":"1610516671","purch