ackgroundColor":{"red":0.8235294117647058,"green":0.7803921568627451,"blue":1,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0.043137254901960784,"green":0.043137254901960784,"blue":0.043137254901960784,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/39/cb/a3/39cba3ef-e634-d3f6-90a0-d864d1fd568a/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"Sharpen - College Exam Prep","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":true,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Quizzes, Videos & Flashcards","tertiaryTitle":"Designed for iPad.\nNot verified for macOS.","tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Quizzes, Videos & Flashcards","ageRating":"13+","productDescription":"Sharpen is the new college study app that revolutionizes exam prep. \n \n\nSharpen assesses your current knowledge, identifies areas for improvement, and provides personalized AI-driven study recommendations to boost your exam readiness. \n \n\nChoose from three quiz modes, flashcards, bite-sized videos, chapter summaries, and practice problems, all seamlessly aligned with your college textbook. Or use Ask Sharpen, your AI study buddy, to break down topics and generate new study content tailored to your queries. \n \n\nFeatures: \n \n\nNEW Ask Sharpen: Enter queries and Sharpen’s AI engine provides deep-dives, links you to related study activities, and generates new learning content.  \nNEW Improve: AI-driven insights show your strengths, knowledge gaps, and personalized study recommendations based on past sessions.  \nQuiz Bank: Thousands of questions across three modes (basic, advanced, and exam). \nExam-like Questions: Fill-in-the-blank, multiple choice with images, standard multiple choice, and single choice. \nExam Timer: Simulate the exam environment with a built-in timer. \nBite-Sized Videos: Concise videos that explain key concepts. \nFlashcards: Learn key terms from your textbook. \nStep-by-Step Practice Problems: Reinforce understanding with detailed practice problems. \nVisual Chapter Summaries: Summarize chapters visually for better retention. \nTrusted Content: Content built by McGraw Hill subject matter experts and aligned to your textbook. \n \n\n \n\nDisciplines covered: \n \n\nMcGraw Hill Textbooks & OpenStax Textbooks: Accounting, Algebra, American Government, American History, Anatomy & Physiology, Biology, Business, Business Law, Business Math, Chemistry, Economics, Engineering, Human Resources, Investments, Management, Marketing, Medical Assisting, Medical Terminology, Microbiology, Music, Nutrition, Psychology, Spanish, and others. \n \n\nTestimonials: \n \n“I’m rocking the exams and my understanding in class thanks to Sharpen.” \n“This app is amazing! It gets right to the point & connects with my book for school.” \n“Fantastic resource! I love the bite-sized lessons, quizzes, and design.” \n \n\nDownload Sharpen today and experience a simpler, more effective way to study for exams and class. \n \n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/ \n ","rating":4.7,"ratingCount":"3.2K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1595642363&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=891484106"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1595642363"},{"locationPosition":9,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Sharpen - College Exam Prep","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1595642363"},{"locationPosition":13,"locationType":"similarItems","nam